---
const home = "https://www.maximoraverse.org/";
---
<!doctype html><html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f7fa" media="(prefers-color-scheme:light)"><meta name="theme-color" content="#090a0c" media="(prefers-color-scheme:dark)"><title>页面未找到 · MatchAll</title><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark;--bg:#f6f7fa;--card:#fff;--text:#161a22;--muted:#687180;--line:#dce2e9;--accent:#2563eb}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px;font:16px/1.65 system-ui,sans-serif;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,#dbeafe,transparent 40%),var(--bg);color:var(--text)}main{width:min(680px,100%);padding:clamp(28px,7vw,64px);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--card) 90%,transparent);box-shadow:0 24px 80px #1e293b14}.code{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.22em;color:var(--accent)}h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,10vw,5rem);line-height:1;margin:.2em 0}.lead{color:var(--muted);max-width:42rem}.actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:28px}a{min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;padding:.75rem 1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;color:inherit;text-decoration:none;background:var(--card)}a.primary{background:var(--text);color:var(--bg)}a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px}@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--bg:#090a0c;--card:#111318;--text:#f4f5f7;--muted:#9ba3b0;--line:#292e37;--accent:#60a5fa}body{background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,#172554,transparent 40%),var(--bg)}}</style></head><body><main><p class="code">ERROR 404</p><h1>这里没有这个页面。</h1><p class="lead">地址可能已更改、输入有误，或内容已经下线。你可以返回服务总览、搜索博客和文档，或者查看服务状态。</p><nav class="actions" aria-label="恢复导航"><a class="primary" href={home}>返回全部服务</a><a href="https://blog.maximoraverse.org/">博客与文档</a><a href="https://status.maximoraverse.org/">服务状态</a></nav></main></body></html>
